<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Trading moderately active. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.25-55.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.75-55.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.75-54.75</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.75-53.75</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.50-52.75</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.50-1.00 higher; 450-500 lbs steady;  500-650 lbs steady. Top 55.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
</text>
